-- Demo: three more finished activities of 2569, from the department
-- newsletters (each one is the event's SAR recap poster; none came with an
-- event poster, so their cards show the colour strip):
--
--   1060  AI Vibe Coding for Web & Mobile Application Development
--         Thu 9 – Fri 10 Apr 2569 (2026), 08.30–16.30, ห้อง 1639 ชั้น 6
--         อาคารวิทยาศาสตร์ 1; speaker นายณภัทร นาคอ่อน, Clear Cut Click
--         Solution. Skill Up programme. Newsletter ฉบับที่ 26 (เม.ย. 2569).
--   1061  Upskill/Reskill: ทักษะดิจิทัลและปัญญาประดิษฐ์เชิงปฏิบัติสำหรับการ
--         ทำงานยุคใหม่ — topics 4–5, Sat 4 – Sun 5 Jul 2569, ห้อง 1227 or
--         online, free; funded by อว. Newsletter ฉบับที่ 50 (ก.ค. 2569). The
--         newsletter gives no times, so 09.00–16.00 is assumed.
--   1062  Future Learning Explorer — study visit, Sun 2 Aug 2569, for the
--         student committee; Skill Up programme. Newsletter ฉบับที่ 58
--         (ส.ค. 2569). No times given, so a full day 07.00–18.00 is assumed.
--
-- Budgets of the Skill Up events are shares of its 150,000 baht for the year
-- (แผนพัฒนานักศึกษา ภาควิชาคอมพิวเตอร์ ปีงบประมาณ 2569, item 3, ผศ.โอภาส);
-- the อว. grant for Upskill/Reskill isn't stated, so it has none.
-- Speakers are named in the descriptions (events have no speaker field).
-- All finished and closed, with certificates (evaluations and certificates
-- come from seed_certificates.sql, which must run after this file).
--
-- Who came, with their year as it was then: in April the 2568 academic
-- year was still running, so today's year-1 students hadn't started and
-- everyone else was a year lower; July and August are in 2569. One no-show
-- each for Vibe Coding and Upskill/Reskill, chosen among students with no
-- other absence that fiscal year.
--
-- Apply AFTER schema, seed, demo_organizer, seed_blacklist. Safe to run
-- again: it removes events 1060–1062 (registrations, check-ins,
-- evaluations, certificates and SAR cascade) first — then run
-- seed_certificates.sql again.
--   docker exec -i cpsu-etms-mysql mysql --default-character-set=utf8mb4 -uroot cpsu_etms < database/seed_skill_up_more.sql
-- =====================================================================

